WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.250
Put a thermometer in a pan of
water and turn the hob up full.

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:09.110
The temperature climbs and climbs,
and the water starts to boil.

3
00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:11.730
Then the thermometer gets stuck.

4
00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:15.010
You leave the heat on full,
and the water bubbles harder,

5
00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:17.490
but the reading will not rise.

6
00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:20.770
Energy is still pouring
in every second.

7
00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:23.490
So where is all that energy going?

8
00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:26.390
In this mission, you'll meet
the internal energy of a

9
00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:28.590
substance, and read a heating curve.

10
00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:31.510
You'll find out what happens
to the temperature while a

11
00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:36.250
substance changes state, and
calculate specific latent heat.

12
00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:40.740
Your mission: find out where the
energy goes when water boils.
